or xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vivek Dubey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135675068,imgsize-57608.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Jaishankar extends national day greetings to Cambodia, hails strong civilisational ties]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/jaishankar-extends-national-day-greetings-to-cambodia-hails-strong-civilisational-ties/articleshow/135674222.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135674222.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[S Jaishankar conveyed warm National Day wishes to Cambodia, celebrating the deep-rooted civilizational connections between the two countries. He praised the successful conclusion of the recent Cambodia-India Bilateral Army Exercise, CINBAX-II, which focused on collaborative training to bolster operational synergy among their armed forces. The exercise allowed both teams to display their professionalism and exchange valuable operational insights, further solidifying the defense partnership between India and Cambodia.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/jaishankar-extends-national-day-greetings-to-cambodia-hails-strong-civilisational-ties/articleshow/135674222.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/jaishankar-extends-national-day-greetings-to-cambodia-hails-strong-civilisational-ties/articleshow/135674222.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-09T12:35:39+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135674342,imgsize-55916.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['True colours exposed': BJP's Giriraj Singh tears into Kharge over Diwali 'khushiyon ka Eid' remark]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/true-colours-exposed-bjps-giriraj-singh-tears-into-kharge-over-diwali-khushiyon-ka-eid-remark/artic